# Mode$ DamagePreventedOnce (CardDamageTable.java:49, triggerpack.go):
# Selfless Squire's ETB effect prevents all damage to the human this turn;
# the AI's Lightning Bolt at the human is prevented, so the Squire's
# "whenever damage that would be dealt to you is prevented" puts three
# +1/+1 counters on it.
startturn human
advance 3
tapformana human 2 W
tapformana human 3 W
tapformana human 4 W
tapformana human 5 W
queue paygeneric W
queue paygeneric W
queue paygeneric W
castspell human 1
resolvestack
resolvestack
tapformana ai 10 R
queue targets human
castspell ai 11
resolvestack
resolvestack
